nes with the concept's big form shadows (deep shadow under the cowl, under the cloak, between the apron and the robe panels, inside the jagged hems). Colours: olive cloak and cream linen (large masses), orange-terracotta apron and red-brick crown, soot-black face, dark iron band. No glow, no smoke, no embers.
